  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Slice the bread rolls in half and hollow out the insides.",
    "Steam the spinach leaves until they are soft and pliable.",
    "Fill each bread roll with a spoonful of feta cheese, a few kalamata olives, some artichoke hearts, and a sprinkle of red onion.",
    "Drizzle the olive oil over the filling and sprinkle with garlic.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Wrap each bread roll in a steamed spinach leaf and serve immediately.",
    "Serve with a side of mixed greens or a simple salad for a light and refreshing meal.",
    "Store any leftovers in an airtight container in the refrigerator for up to 2 days."
